    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d157-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0561" n="347" sameAs="frus:frus1871/pg347"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegraphic dispatch from London.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Washburne to Mr. Fish</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1871-05-23"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            23, <hi rendition="#italic">noon</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fish</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Desperate fighting for thirty-six hours. Still continues. Versailles gains ground
                    slowly, but surely.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WASHBURNE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
